    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a47">

                <pb facs="0573" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg523"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 47.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-14"><hi rendition="#italic">May 14, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received afternoon of 14th.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have just received a long note complaining that the Portuguese Government took
                    the responsibility of asylum granted and did not hold the refugees, and have
                    received the passports of the personnel of the legation of Portugal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paraty.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
